no! No U Snake: a turn-based terminal Snake clone using only the original operators and seven builtins. !no
no! Controls: w/a/s/d move, q quits. Food movement is deterministic because No U has no randomness. !no
no! Function bindings: <TAB><SP>=node, then one additional space for field, collision, trim-tail, and render. !no
nooooo uuuuuu
	no! make-node(x, y, next): capture values outside the selector function's parameter slots. !no
	no u, NO			 U
	no  u, NO			  U
	no   u, NO			   U
	nooooo uuuuuu 
		no! node(selector): 0=x, 1=y, 2=next. !no
		No, NO			    u
		no u, !0!, !, !
		NO U !
			no			 u, NO			    u
		no u, !1!, !, !
		NO U !
			no			  u, NO			    u
		no u, !2!, !, !
		NO U !
			no			   u, NO			    u
		no			    u 
NO	 U
